data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","sequence_number":104,"item_id":"rs_0093b505ebce2fc0016acaabf894f887d189e644c0726ab9c3","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Considering implementation details**\n\nI need to implement and test the browser feature using a fake DOM, without any dependencies. I'm wondering how much time I have left and if the token limit is around 24 with an 8,000 budget now at 11. I want to make sure the API is integrated with all projects, including fields for counts and migration. I’ll focus on UI filtering for local and archive callbacks, possibly skipping actual browser tests in favor of minimal node tests for UI. My main focus is on the migration testing."}}

